          "snippet": {
            "line": 104,
            "text": "theorem partialX_radialFlux (Ω : RadialDomain) {U : Field}\n    (hU : ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ U Ω.carrier) (h lam : ℝ) {p : Point} (hp : p ∈ Ω.carrier)\n    (hL : CoordinateAlgebra.L h p.2 ≠ 0) :\n    SimilarityProfile.partialX (radialFlux h lam U) p =\n      -SimilarityProfile.Z h (-CoordinateAlgebra.A h + lam) U p"
          }
